---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
const contourPaths = Array.from({ length: 17 }, (_, ring) => {
  const points = Array.from({ length: 73 }, (_, point) => {
    const angle = point / 72 * Math.PI * 2;
    const radius = 17 + ring * 8.8;
    const wobble = 1 + Math.sin(angle * 3 + ring * .09) * .14 + Math.cos(angle * 5) * .07;
    return `${point === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'}${(275 + Math.cos(angle) * radius * wobble * 1.3).toFixed(1)} ${(158 + Math.sin(angle) * radius * wobble).toFixed(1)}`;
  });
  return `${points.join(' ')}Z`;
});
---
<Base title="Lab" description="Two hands-on browser experiments: explore a generative flow field or create your own topographic map and winding trail.">
  <section class="container section lab-gallery">
    <div class="gallery-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">The lab / Small ideas, set loose</p><h1>No brief.<br />Just <span>curiosity.</span></h1></div><div class="gallery-note"><span class="note-symbol" aria-hidden="true">{'{ * }'}</span><p>Code can be useful.<br />It can also be a little wonder.</p><span class="local-note">Browser-native / No account / No install</span></div></div>
    <p class="lab-intro muted">Two experiments at the intersection of tech and the outdoors. Change the rules, find a pattern, take the long way around.</p>
    <div class="experiment-gallery">
      <a class="experiment-tile flow-tile" href="/lab/flow-field/">
        <div class="tile-preview field-preview" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="preview-label">Vector field / preview</span>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 560 340" fill="none">
            <g class="flow-lines" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2">{Array.from({ length: 22 }, (_, index) => <path pathLength="1" d={`M-30 ${60 + index * 10}C90 ${-45 + index * 11} 150 ${285 + index * 4} 270 ${125 + index * 5}S440 ${50 + index * 7} 590 ${155 + index * 7}`} style={`--line-delay: ${index * .035}s`} />)}</g>
            <g fill="currentColor"><circle cx="116" cy="104" r="2" /><circle cx="263" cy="182" r="2" /><circle cx="391" cy="110" r="2" /><circle cx="430" cy="211" r="2" /><circle cx="183" cy="171" r="1.5" /></g>
          </svg>
          <span class="preview-bottom">Sine + cosine → unexpected paths</span>
          <span class="preview-arrow">↗</span>
        </div>
        <div class="tile-content"><div class="tile-meta"><span>Lab / 001</span><span>Canvas · Motion</span></div><h2>Flow field</h2><p>A thousand particles. One invisible set of directions. Steer the speed and color of a field that never quite settles.</p><span class="experiment-link">Follow the flow <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></div>
      </a>
      <a class="experiment-tile topo-tile" href="/lab/topo-trail/">
        <div class="tile-preview topo-preview" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="preview-label">Imaginary terrain / preview</span>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 560 340" fill="none"><g class="contour-lines" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width=".9">{contourPaths.map((path, index) => <path d={path} opacity={index % 4 === 0 ? '.75' : '.35'} />)}</g><path class="preview-trail-shadow" d="M172 297C90 229 229 260 203 199S351 207 301 147 430 130 382 48" /><path class="preview-trail" pathLength="1" d="M172 297C90 229 229 260 203 199S351 207 301 147 430 130 382 48" /><circle cx="172" cy="297" r="4" class="trail-end" /><circle cx="382" cy="48" r="4" class="trail-end" /></svg>
          <span class="preview-bottom">Value noise → a way through</span><span class="preview-arrow">↗</span>
        </div>
        <div class="tile-content"><div class="tile-meta"><span>Lab / 002</span><span>Canvas · Terrain</span></div><h2>Topo trail</h2><p>Generate a landscape that doesn’t exist. Tune its contours, trace a winding trail, and download a map that’s yours alone.</p><span class="experiment-link">Find your own way <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></div>
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="lab-footnote"><span aria-hidden="true">↳</span><p>No tracking inside the experiments. No server doing the drawing. Just your browser and a few rules. Previews above are illustrations; open an experiment to take control. Reduced motion is respected.</p></div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .gallery-heading { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: end; gap: 32px; }
  .gallery-heading h1 { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .gallery-note { padding-bottom: 12px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }
  .note-symbol { color: var(--accent); font: 32px var(--font-mono); }
  .local-note { display: block; font: 9px/1.7 var(--font-mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em; }
  .lab-intro { max-width: 590px; font-size: 1.1rem; margin-top: 28px; }
  .experiment-gallery { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 44px; margin-top: 60px; align-items: start; }
  .experiment-tile { display: block; color: var(--text); text-decoration: none; min-width: 0; }
  .topo-tile { margin-top: 80px; }
  .tile-preview { position: relative; border: 1px solid var(--line); overflow: hidden; background: var(--bg); border-radius: 12px; color: var(--accent); isolation: isolate; transition: border-color .25s, box-shadow .25s; }
  .tile-preview svg { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
  .field-preview { background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, var(--soft), var(--bg) 70%); }
  .preview-label, .preview-bottom { position: absolute; left: 20px; z-index: 1; font: 9px var(--font-mono); color: var(--muted); }
  .preview-label { top: 20px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; padding: 6px 8px; background: var(--bg); border-radius: 3px; }
  .preview-bottom { bottom: 20px; }
  .preview-arrow { position: absolute; right: 18px; bottom: 14px; font-size: 25px; color: var(--text); transition: transform .25s; }
  .flow-lines path { animation: flow-in 3s ease-out var(--line-delay) both; }
  .flow-lines path:nth-child(3n) { opacity: .35; }
  .flow-lines path:nth-child(3n + 1) { opacity: .65; }
  .preview-trail-shadow { stroke: var(--bg); stroke-width: 7px; }
  .preview-trail { stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 2px; stroke-linecap: round; animation: flow-in 3.5s ease-out both; }
  .trail-end { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 1.5px; }
  .tile-content { padding-top: 24px; }
  .tile-meta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; color: var(--muted); font: 10px var(--font-mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .07em; }
  .tile-meta span:first-child { color: var(--accent); }
  .tile-content h2 { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); letter-spacing: -.045em; margin: 17px 0 12px; }
  .tile-content p { color: var(--muted); max-width: 460px; margin-top: 0; }
  .experiment-link { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 18px 0; margin-top: 26px; color: var(--accent); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }
  .experiment-tile:hover .tile-preview, .experiment-tile:focus-visible .tile-preview { border-color: var(--accent); box-shadow: 0 12px 44px var(--ambient); }
  .experiment-tile:hover .preview-arrow { transform: translate(3px, -3px); }
  .lab-footnote { display: flex; gap: 22px; align-items: baseline; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); margin-top: 55px; padding-top: 24px; color: var(--muted); }
  .lab-footnote > span { color: var(--accent); font-size: 28px; }
  .lab-footnote p { font-size: 12px; max-width: 740px; }
  @keyframes flow-in { from { stroke-dasharray: 1; stroke-dashoffset: 1; } to { stroke-dasharray: 1; stroke-dashoffset: 0; } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .flow-lines path, .preview-trail { animation: none; } .tile-preview, .preview-arrow { transition: none; } }
  @media (max-width: 800px) { .gallery-heading { flex-direction: column; align-items: start; gap: 20px; } .gallery-note { display: none; } .experiment-gallery { gap: 26px; } .preview-label, .preview-bottom { left: 12px; font-size: 8px; } .preview-label { top: 12px; } .preview-bottom { bottom: 14px; } }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .experiment-gallery { grid-template-columns: 1fr; margin-top: 38px; gap: 42px; } .topo-tile { margin-top: 0; } .tile-content { padding-top: 20px; } .lab-footnote { margin-top: 32px; gap: 12px; } }
</style>
